evidence = "Commit 08da21d2377053a40a0d0eb5793d404b4bcac9c6 removed environment-dependent BENS routes, and services/explorer/backend/apps/explorer/lib/explorer/microservice_interfaces/bens.ex:153 still emits hyphenated paths while services/explorer/backend/apps/block_scout_web/test/block_scout_web/controllers/api/v2/address_controller_test.exs:1143, :2831 and :2944 still register underscore paths, despite separate production-path coverage in services/explorer/backend/apps/explorer/test/repair/repair_22_33_455_test.exs:153."
close_comment = "Three controller regressions still expect obsolete underscore BENS routes. The repair will migrate their HTTP listeners to production paths while preserving ENS enrichment, metadata, and request-payload checks."

